sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI/ASGI Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>Bearer Token (conditional)
    participant Router as API Router<br/>(OpenAI/Anthropic/Pooling)
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over FastAPI,Engine: Startup: Model Loading Flow
    FastAPI->>Engine: Initialize engine
    alt S3 model source
        Engine->>S3: Download model weights (boto3)<br/>AWS credentials / HTTPS
        S3-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    else HuggingFace Hub source
        Engine->>HF: Download model (huggingface_hub)<br/>HTTPS / optional auth token
        HF-->>Engine: Model weights & config
    end
    Note over Engine: Model loaded into memory

    Note over Client,Engine: Runtime: Inference Request Flow
    Client->>FastAPI: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    alt API key configured (--api-key or VLLM_API_KEY)
        FastAPI->>Auth: Forward request
        Auth->>Auth: Check path prefix (/v1, /v2, /inference)
        Auth->>Auth: Validate Bearer token<br/>SHA-256 hash + secrets.compare_digest
        alt Token valid
            Auth->>Router: Authenticated request
        else Token invalid
            Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        end
    else No API key configured
        FastAPI->>Router: Pass through (no auth)
    end
    Router->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>Engine: Run LLM inference
    alt Streaming response
        Engine-->>Router: SSE stream chunks
        Router-->>FastAPI: Stream response
        FastAPI-->>Client: text/event-stream
    else Non-streaming response
        Engine-->>Router: Complete result
        Router-->>FastAPI: JSON response
        FastAPI-->>Client: application/json
    end

    Note over Client,Engine: Runtime: LoRA Adapter Hot-Loading
    Client->>FastAPI: POST /v1/load_lora_adapter<br/>Bearer token (if configured)
    FastAPI->>Auth: Validate (if auth active)
    Auth->>Router: Forward
    Router->>Engine: Load LoRA adapter
    alt Filesystem source
        Engine->>Engine: Load from local path
    else HuggingFace source
        Engine->>HF: Resolve & download adapter<br/>HTTPS
        HF-->>Engine: LoRA weights
    end
    Engine-->>Router: Adapter loaded
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,FastAPI: Health & Operational Probes (Unauthenticated)
    Client->>FastAPI: GET /health
    Note right of FastAPI: No auth guard<br/>(outside /v1, /v2, /inference prefix)
    FastAPI-->>Client: 200 OK
    Client->>FastAPI: GET /ready
    FastAPI-->>Client: 200 OK (if model loaded)
